# Copy this file to .env and fill in your key. .env is never committed
# (see .gitignore) — run.py loads it via load_dotenv() before anything
# else, so this becomes visible only to this process.
#
# Only needed if app/config.yaml has conversation.provider: anthropic —
# it's used for narration, chat and the per-hunk briefings. Not needed for
# the default provider: ollama — that talks to a local Ollama server
# instead, no API key required. Act Now and Look deeper don't read this
# key: they run through Cline, which uses its own credentials (`cline auth`).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
